{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:40a84e02825d034610deb52c0330a1cd67b00ec0f2a1829b2c7f2f6e15372c32",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5958e802d61a4400a0c52fde005ddfc30f23411f932a170fb0265ebfde2a112e",
      "text": "下一个舞台",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3065c5f56fe64fa760e1514850bff31f24b794e550ce1e04bb3b56c764e7e70",
      "text": "为缺钱所困的教师山下，某天收到了来自\n同僚硲和舞田的邀请，问他要不要一起去当偶像。\n听完两人充满激情与梦想的话语，\n山下的回答是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000009:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000009:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5958e802d61a4400a0c52fde005ddfc30f23411f932a170fb0265ebfde2a112e",
      "text": "下一个舞台",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b00c79024b565de54a8d0cae36fe084709873a9da523b3aec02ac08dfb1c3050",
      "text": "唉～真没办法。\n运气真差啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fb7ed919af810dfb0e0ba6be693219c3c8de3e6229d436d1a5d968a61ebe6f3",
      "text": "（真没想到冰箱会坏掉呢。\n虽然顺利买新的换上了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7a6c5c2e5fc2ca88e2fed608fee6b4fe5f9fd8707db0dc703fbc5a38df70402",
      "text": "（意料之外的开销，大叔的钱包要告急喽。\n离发工资还有几天来着……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60cd6d28545674925378b0047f1b027b3149341d140dc235cc0c29aa51c41c9b",
      "text": "（必须想办法熬过去才行，\n不然特意买的新冰箱就毫无意义了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54998b0d67feb9e6c723f8d696c68eaff55e6e27d777b1aeb63fbdafa2ea99e6",
      "text": "有没有什么好办法呢……\n……哦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45835127ab8256a3d59e6d63b4ce3f14827e8e0b0e25af7840aa011368446f51",
      "text": "（赛马直播吗。\n说起来今天确实有比赛来着）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbf62793b44b03e30bd834c7692bfdf810f48fde31efbecf47a9f985e4d1b23e",
      "text": "（……等等。\n这种时候，要不要试着孤注一掷逆转一把？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9eca58a1cdea33d716daa2d14859f33d6e1b00dbc05793ac6f7d939ad5d87ee",
      "text": "（冰箱坏了的事，\n应该已经把霉运都用光了吧……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d26890499eddbdc1c467861119ce120be2814607369dc5d3291a42449210b1ab",
      "text": "（按顺序来说，接下来\n该轮到好事发生了才对吧！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1412f90da75f5752096e44a108933165e93d6c79a0296c1c2e039c972611049c",
      "text": "好，来试试运气吧！\n看起来势头正盛的马是……哇哦！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc01b712efc5238bb93bf2462c6df4bec4e751db4c40decb3bc4528a4dc99cb3",
      "text": "对、对不起！我赶时间！\n您没事吧！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_b:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:278ceebcc114dd99ae66d6e504d689f1387d2378302a5ad54f40fcc4639d73fc",
      "text": "撞到您了，实在非常抱歉！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6b8d4c31e5d4b584b186ece286c71653c8566e72862920b25205a120f051efa",
      "text": "没有没有，我没事。我这边在路边突然停下来\n才是不好意思呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c9a5b1fbcc71f8aa286930b8a38787c31a8c43b80a3c45fe028e5b701e4d360",
      "text": "不，我自己也没有好好看路……\n真的非常抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93f7c11490c83386342ece8e4753f39ed8aef7b8d1d21c8c340717c1d6ec6331",
      "text": "哈哈……照这样下去，\n两个人互相道歉就没完没了啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb5a594b7799fac5aadfbf87556f976a669e743dd16cba050a0fb1da9633847a",
      "text": "嗯——……对了。要说是赔礼的话，\n能不能帮我猜一下这场赛马的结果？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ca9a437967d749c47f8caa0d83a7e35c492b66e3a29dac1c62a88b76a441f8e",
      "text": "赛马……吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ff03751382c3834b286f5180aae64f30f59e68db688e8172fce52707c791a00",
      "text": "凭直觉就行，这里面哪匹马可能会拿第一名，\n希望能告诉我一下呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e324602f5d3f807fefa8fc0ce8e30c1673c1bca0437a806f8f05af19c3e3023",
      "text": "真、真的凭直觉就行吗？\n那个……那就这匹吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bfc11190d804da5bf8e5efebcfec88e0a579237a18b4f24bd5dc14805f306fb",
      "text": "哦，“无限梦想”啊。\n选了个挺有意思的冷门嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ea2a930db820b467311705202fff4849a20d8a6c9aa4b6b404bd393416c6860",
      "text": "那个……虽然很想看到最后的结果，\n但我还有下一份工作……抱歉！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7680f3ad2736b860c5fba7fcbe2f3c9f7561cdd69b7aa321b2ca8f944dc65055",
      "text": "哎呀，是我耽误你了才对，不好意思啊。\n那路上小心哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6918544b5deb5e125572894504743cb0b9d5384e8f88d276888786161745e94",
      "text": "（……明明我自己也有责任，\n那人却一直道歉到最后呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab8a0889737fcee3b79a3196dee76b12b5758bae3f46d11ce670138f29c7899b",
      "text": "（虽然看起来挺忙的，\n到底是做什么工作的人呢？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2e1a4f34fed88ac7e40d740a7f8d2a5be3dad863238a14f21d5328969944767",
      "text": "……算了。那么，被选中的是\n“无限梦想”来着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b35ac6b3c622708e83e4209ef74cdfa6757cff6faea8407f52e06ff5513c4285",
      "text": "像是类那家伙会起的名字的马呢。\n嘛，随便猜猜怎么可能会中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12e65a1cdbdc01b093811cd870db56d3174f93166351b721d92356d2fd696247",
      "text": "在这里发力的是“无限梦想”！\n从稍落后的位置一口气追了上来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56247ec6397a4c8ba5a42217deb6549dc09241091cecb51c69fa4d339cfa0f22",
      "text": "节奏很好！速度丝毫不减！\n以极其迅猛的气势逼近第一名！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f9e928f3f98da8f3c2ac82043f8c56309e5ba8f09235050538cd4cc54831d18",
      "text": "……哎、咦？\n怎么好像势头很不错……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75281424be5e765864fb2d278acfa838370203a78c07abf97ee9250d413dede8",
      "text": "冲线前夕，“无限梦想”跃居\n首位！第一名是“无限梦想”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee8fe9f9883680dcc2942ae21bbfe992f9ced097c67de6d45359a10d43ad84d7",
      "text": "拿、拿到第一名冲线了……！？\n真的假的！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2eb6274b2cd72965fb3d60846e3dcc88dd60dee241d6f791ad9c3bd236358df8",
      "text": "（等等、等一下。\n刚才那个人，还在附近吗！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c544bd8625e80203e74790728e81bd76accb37782e21369413f0462ec69cfac",
      "text": "（……呜，不在了吗。真该要个联系方式的。\n下一场比赛还想沾沾光的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6aa7fa6a52fff4b6a2c38f8d9362e32bffb35c8e0c82b2a8ca3d1bca0b795a56",
      "text": "不过话说回来，居然一上来就猜中大冷门啊。\n这种身负鸿运的人还真是有呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_d:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc6e2aafeb9e125b69d1b143f05c66414e6e1a4f46c163a52a6d289efeef27c7",
      "text": "学校",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f58e3f2dfe1adc36a57d0b5efb9f0e2ed0391939594280065d9b8b33493c7d10",
      "text": "（……头疼。\n到发工资之前，钱包果然很吃紧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b9eaf53ee07bc7f43b66f499de934f0bc090cff65f209470cf7564ac3c0e371",
      "text": "（这种时候……去找硲先生商量的话，\n说不定能借我点午饭钱？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3bd9c237d4516db74f7acdd56c6c2cbad5fb4a32c4f90ff88eb4ad6d2b39d45",
      "text": "哦，在呢在呢。类也在一起啊。\n硲先生，能打扰一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de80fd2a03c982dcbe996f6f593bdcbeb22a4859d24f2eb6f2447015a12b198a",
      "text": "是山下君啊。\n有什么事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15d63d4c0d693080737795466a75b5ffd878d1ec94525620f022a167fa5f1689",
      "text": "那个……不好意思。这个月有点吃紧，\n能稍微借我点零钱的话～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_d:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4487acd3abcc510635351717848a6b6584c9a00814069c4565be03d13bca3ca1",
      "text": "又来了吗，山下君……真拿你没办法。\n一顿午饭钱的程度我还是能借你的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_d:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4cc1fa62c237a4d26f0d7483a2f9de45d21d85fd1319346145071db5d0e5b00",
      "text": "Mr. 硲，这样好吗？\n这么爽快就借出去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ee948cc73b58f67b350da71a313b416eb5bc26c368de1fd2c777ccf85cf1cd2",
      "text": "我们从今天起就要变成无业游民了耶☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_d:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a13b49c1ba42d92a324db1db66f2dcbd193661ddb08fcc32672fc131c56816a4",
      "text": "真的，在这种时候还真是抱歉……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_d:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f11e4243de42cb4789af72a1f44acb91de8d4fc6ced61662ee612ffdc11b2989",
      "text": "……哈？等、等等，类。\n你刚才说什么？变成无业游民？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_d:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58caeb069f2aaa6fdb154b1cd281638406874e3fe65603baffe7ec78fcfda2f9",
      "text": "嗯！我和Mr. 硲，从今天起都是无业游民啦！\n要向着Next stage前进了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_e:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d804d0b09c883b3f2c70856ae92573a4de9b8caa516d6963f6a87366d00c7dd",
      "text": "正如舞田君所说，我刚才\n已经辞去了教师职务。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1854b99efe3091cfc35f42ae70cad94d78cd464a11b063598158e5d62c29c5c5",
      "text": "辞职了……这也太突然了吧。\n发生什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c966d5c3901816319f77aac92151b3ee312633b13a05c87f7278f23c8bd3d035",
      "text": "嗨嗨！Mr. 山下！\n我也是和Mr. 硲一起辞职的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fdd58c8b46c305b5b81a234f43f8b0a8cf26832a3ec1228bd690ef7cdcd7ad4",
      "text": "啊——是，舞田类君。\n能问问理由吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0abe6aeb34430b53608009cef15317e0e8603f631ec1c07baa06d1ee44648f6",
      "text": "因为那边看起来更有意思嘛☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_e:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c41464fe4a4863f1643ef1539b22af406d54b587057ba248db081b7b62a871f3",
      "text": "……我就猜到类会这么说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_e:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07bf5c8ced97b9caac4c69f5a5759c01d3cf40bcbc2994bb72480813930a4f9f",
      "text": "跟着一时兴起过日子的类先不谈，\n为什么连硲先生也？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_e:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3770b0d679387d2395f8de7023d0a5033e97e97e7a85c50705f7b12b15d583f5",
      "text": "啊，我本就打算找机会和山下君\n谈一谈的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_e:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c359be696e1e63c9bd031c0c4ce19a85027ee0e649a68ae510016ee168dbc189",
      "text": "前几天，不是有叫Jupiter的偶像\n来参加我们学校的文化祭吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_e:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:669d5082c38b175b7d7cf4f311c6715bc96b634f80226e6c4b08b4c5d93b0b09",
      "text": "记得说是类的朋友当偶像来着吧。\n还给我们办了Live……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_e:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bbe6584b9e0126faba768e4a50a7b900d3c355d8c94983f5f64412d82fd0791",
      "text": "没错。……正是那场Live，\n让我意识到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3081715a7ab3f7550973d10f6272f5a1a5f7de18c4e4300a531631f1e3d704e0",
      "text": "数天前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0944154bed1e746e0eb2601f24909328b0786c61afd78f77848c112814ee42f",
      "text": "虽说事先听说过文化祭上会有偶像办Live……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c272d0619f73dfb11cc071042ee6e426f0d828451441fee33b248d1e248ca112",
      "text": "没想到能吸引如此多的学生，\n偶像真是一种了不起的存在啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0242c38027b07b46ef2632bc216998df7498d8a94d6eb60e50c7370df4018099",
      "text": "是让人Exciting的dance和song呢～\n我也看得入迷了哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7038edd8302450ebc79d1d5811a51730ce476bc3cbd7f2a6a31d7fe1d0d177a3",
      "text": "嘛，学生们正值这个年纪嘛。\n比起枯燥的授课，绝对是看这个更开心吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d927881f8dc090629b3dc71b8ce36d18d1b0ce7010284a4f8931407f48e4608",
      "text": "唔，原来是这样吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf3c01e6e1618a6a4f02d19e855502f2e4cffc32183caf724ed08cf54c28bf7b",
      "text": "……学生们全体看向同一个方向，\n发出了充满活力的呼声。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdcfdebff28eeb9add13324e545234dbde5724d887e060dee4696efce0dc6943",
      "text": "听说Live开始前，\n学生们维持排队秩序时也非常认真。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4fed1ab2af8a423741ef689610ddc324bcfac54e2e5067d29d0fa148980fc04",
      "text": "偶像，竟然能如此程度地\n吸引年轻人的关注吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6551b5a7813b409d8511e54c06311cd4a2d5f5e03e4c2a41c1daff821d8d8184",
      "text": "……这样啊。为了引导学生们，\n所需要的正是这个啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:957657a7fc2450e619b8d690c277a250de40050cfc308792755a9255cbc88263",
      "text": "Mr. 硲？\n从刚才起就一直在碎碎念，怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ae296a133ca6c63f0474ebe2d874e25ab8e98d7925b4d3e8e3dae12e2efaaeb",
      "text": "我决定了，舞田君。\n我要……成为偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_g:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1eca04f423e5e623d297b51921bd04709840ed97644153758898fbdba5c1346",
      "text": "我自认为一直以来都在为学生着想，\n为他们的教育倾注了全部心血。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:141207be3f7aa160fee34a8f5e656dce42509eeee5aa8b241c15fef6be0ba677",
      "text": "为了让他们对学业产生兴趣，\n想尽了各种各样的办法。……但是，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_g:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:938bf30d3a09fcf0b587d83e262ff2b378441c50283b5961ded221c440d9df2a",
      "text": "我所推行的“讲大道理的办法”，\n是行不通的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_g:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c8e7c17fac77a5f09aae9964dfffe41c5fca5bf2926f30a3f699ef70b807e92",
      "text": "必须要有贴合学生们的方法才行……\n那就是，偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_g:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bb651916c7fc483e91ce5cc332e1a87b955400ab6afb4227231147c5c11b034",
      "text": "……原来如此啊。我明白你为什么突然说要\n去当偶像了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_g:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62b7172e9402f9b146922f67fb62eddfc406d3f264ba5470927eae20d7b9e819",
      "text": "（这个人真是，看起来冷冰冰的，内心其实火热得很呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_g:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e7fc7158448c1b7e28d187ca6a3366c309bb267a68437653aa28dc191da603c",
      "text": "想必山下君也看到了吧。\n学生们那充满光彩的表情！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_g:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c19d65f25cbbad12b25383bfef12cf6c393e01c9404fff03c7ccc3038082ea58",
      "text": "至今为止，我一次也没能让学生们\n露出那样的表情……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_g:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:090ad8c1f5428c8d054e394adbf0875967962b10852b8528c1698490c97bc337",
      "text": "但如果我也成为偶像，\n这次一定能够引导学生们！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_g:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25115a8543aee2d096a49a05d57b38519d3394967b37f79e6ea98b390f8aba29",
      "text": "我要成为偶像！……然后，\n一定要让学生们萌生出对学业的热情！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_h:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4af415bfd673ad5c1723df326fb8fd1ffb1b2f38c4b8b5e1e4468906fa2c4b5",
      "text": "……所以接下来，你是打算和类一起\n去当偶像的意思吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_h:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:933342ab72034bfb7f2c5c12492cb0007f8a1cb02b08414d3177bae4d8d0a7f1",
      "text": "That's right！\n听起来很有意思吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_h:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e474b323d1396131a9da12b8d294cfa4c42aaf8907e5df09b1ca92019335acd4",
      "text": "不，嘛……\n我虽然理解了硲先生的热情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a66ed4b67266ac2e4f720f147f1996dfcca617dc84fc37df127f955badd90cfe",
      "text": "现实问题是，实际情况如何呢？\n真的有能当上偶像的指望吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_h:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c6fbcd6481387a5e7f88324497c0ef826fbadf79b1d93705598ae202ff24171",
      "text": "我打算首先和舞田君一起，\n去四处参加试镜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_h:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03968d409ed2fa2f5c68bcf9d2726f87bcf4fd02897d092038251ff0abb94f21",
      "text": "两个人脚踏实地地干啊。\n看起来挺辛苦的呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_h:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d63bd12c33f0fa10079844e35e805b1b764e41b47a9cb461d33a4c93ce05e6ba",
      "text": "关于这件事，山下君，其实我也想\n邀请你一起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_h:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d459263f5c27e1ea2157b40532f188debf2d061dc8ce48ce0765bb372d5cd710",
      "text": "诶？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_h:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e8a9080cd9d645e7b79e2469dd87470e84c72fa966259cdc37346168369502e",
      "text": "来我们文化祭的Jupiter，\n是三人组合吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_h:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d2a4c46c1a338a460b2deef8afac2299baa21aeba5f007e13d5b2f76118e258",
      "text": "……我不仅希望舞田君，\n也希望你能来帮我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_h:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d09e78c437ab8524d5e9a95ed955c79f23581ee1efd990d760da9b8cba732dce",
      "text": "山下君，要不要和我们一起以偶像为目标？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bed52567d66f62e98ac90b5a91a20d246a351b4c764fb6b3c939287ffdd14855",
      "text": "让我当偶像……你是认真的吗？\n我可是今年都30岁的大男人了哦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a31589212e8c4d81ca92a75dd9d23d32d5a9bf6ef8b9b1f4c56f4918a5fd486",
      "text": "我32岁了。热情与年龄无关。\n请务必也借给我们一份力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9098d2e189c2522f8ec516891fdfd50f658707524860f34ea904d0f001dec503",
      "text": "就算你突然这么说……\n我也完全没有实感啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cbefa4edd35b1b52816f460233c79c6b0cd1dd69055c843a758944b2ad43de3",
      "text": "Mr. 山下，一起来做嘛！\n绝对超开心的，成功了还能大赚一笔哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26c84cfa45a09144be8950079ac21958b901f721e3bd34e22a8def93fa38dc6d",
      "text": "大……赚一笔？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdb3e1ac4cef41f88a18b39fc5ac54dfbb92db5a770b021df56e300911f74d47",
      "text": "Yes！我听Jupiter的北斗说的。\n当偶像可是many many money呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ceefb57483c022f85dcb806237e84ca9390d215134ab8cc3d83fd7882fe35783",
      "text": "many……many……money？那岂不是，\n连梦寐以求的马主都能当上了吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f6c857e108b2f8351e460d85d69adf16b8241b80016a5ffe996a46313d7618b",
      "text": "那种程度very easy啦☆\n除此以外，还能住高层豪宅之类的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f08eec91c397aea4b280600edc57a4919cf7a1aaf3be7180a9962fe228f67e4e",
      "text": "住高层豪宅……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbe20461e63038a1cbc7df7dd931bc8b61d4d05e08451cd1988207b488357db3",
      "text": "在海外建rich的度假别墅啦，\n用Money泡满浴缸洗澡啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b66c98e3a418dd473851a209da41d58d022e456a14459018a74329febe48dfe",
      "text": "豪华别墅……！？\n泡满money的浴缸……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0062383080d69b26b17640ca2422768070a9a037ca9cc2517c576bd42769ea5",
      "text": "怎么样，Mr. 山下？\n干劲……涌上来了吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_j:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a689f62d53c951cd4e0ba546870a0bf7d98fdb2518a2141a6a48680be60b3c20",
      "text": "请务必借给我们一份力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_j:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de89215431ca5ec04d90e2d8987da9691048c8143e45e5e9a9bc54343c019ea3",
      "text": "……像我这样的人加进去，能帮上什么忙吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_j:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70ffe731baf0d38f9885b469efbbe545814eb6d5fa4a5963358637e53f50fe64",
      "text": "当然能啦！我们三个人一起成功，\n然后一起enjoy人生吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_j:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:300c79387495198e0074ffe69859e3f090940e58ab1cd4b0ee51d02fc46bfa05",
      "text": "……\n享受人生……吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_j:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:603dc404e1abe60ecebb035c8ccf59c1bb8aa69ee9c473bcd77103347c70630d",
      "text": "或许我们的目的各不相同，\n但每个人都一定能获得巨大的收获。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_j:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f053bc5a33eafc16e9375584725ee767443407f0dc77abc36b77e90782c1b8e",
      "text": "意下如何，山下君。\n能不能请你认真考虑一下呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_j:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8caa18a0ca27dd9c260a6f2e114356761dbbdd2f48fa7d4d6f91af2bb22eb86",
      "text": "Mr. 山下！只要是我们，\n绝对会成功的，no problem啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_j:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:207340283a29f3c9852a60badc147f8af24c953a958b0492ec5bfb2771096b77",
      "text": "……哈哈，绝对会成功，吗。\n那还真是桩美事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_j:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ae382ee44cf7e2cc5a38ab96cd4d9e27426c740dd802ec04dcc04bff94e7059",
      "text": "Mr. 山下！\n这么说来！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_j:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b926979af74282f5338a8657a0dc76d3903bf016294b123c7cfffbacf3bd908",
      "text": "那就试试看吧……当偶像。\n虽然不知道能做到什么地步就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_j:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c26b3e5bf4490b138d151b57ab22a176a5a1712f38544206abe44d00f05dfef7",
      "text": "山下君……谢谢你！\n让我们三人一起，向着偶像迈进吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
